    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Fintan Cahill Auctioneers are delighted to introduce 95 Rampart View to the market, a superbly maintained four-bedroom, four-bathroom semi-detached home located in one of Virginia’s most popular residential developments. \r\n\r\nExtending across three well-designed floors, this spacious property offers modern comfort, stylish interiors, and excellent presentation throughout.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation has been carefully planned to maximise both space and functionality. On the ground floor, there is a bright and inviting living room, an open-plan kitchen and dining area with access to the rear garden, a separate utility room, and a guest WC.\r\n\r\nThe first floor comprises three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a bedroom with en-suite facilities, together with a contemporary family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe top floor is dedicated entirely to the impressive master bedroom suite, which includes a walk-in wardrobe and a large en-suite bathroom, creating a private and relaxing retreat away from the main living accommodation.\r\n\r\nRampart View enjoys a prime location within walking distance of Virginia town centre, where a wide selection of everyday amenities can be found, including schools, retail outlets, cafés, restaurants, and recreational facilities. The area is further complemented by nearby amenities such as Deerpark Forest, Virginia Golf Club, and a range of sporting facilities. Excellent road connections make commuting to neighbouring towns and cities both convenient and efficient.\r\n\r\nCombining generous living space, modern design, and an excellent location, 95 Rampart View is an ideal family home and a fantastic opportunity for prospective purchasers. Viewing comes highly recommended."
      },
